{"type": "say", "text": "Alright everyone, we're two weeks out from the first production customer launch for the event-ingestion service. Before I make the binding architecture decision and record the operating plan, I need to hear the final checks from application architecture and compliance, per our normal review routine. Both the streaming and hourly batch architectures passed the functional test suite in dev, so we're in good shape there. Let's get those final reviews on the table so we can move forward."}
